    "detailed_description": "Moonshine? <strong>BORING</strong>! You will cook <strong>MOLESHINE</strong>! Grow ingredients in your garden, make moonshine and upgrade it with the main ingredient - a pesky <strong>MOLE </strong>that wants to eat your crop!<br><br>You got a ruined, abandoned farm, which is constantly raided by stubborn moles who want to eat your crops! Clear rubble, fix your garden and plant different crops to make the most unusual types of moonshine! Don't forget about pest control, defend your crops with your own hands, or build a solid defense system!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go through the entire process of making moonshine with unique recipes that you have to discover<br></li><li>Farm life management, repair, upgrade and sow<br></li><li>Defend your farm from mole attacks on your own or with the help of a variety of defensive means<br></li><li>Sell \u200b\u200bthe finished product and spend the proceeds on the farm</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dont forget to:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293400/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1734674709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293400/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1734674709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293400/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1734674709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293400/extras/906a33c7beacfa0d3bfddbe8c52561d9.poster.avif?t=1734674709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293400/extras/906a33c7beacfa0d3bfddbe8c5256